	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratia et pax, vir ornatissime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">A coena venit ad me publicus hic <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>tabellio<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Unbekannt.</note> et petiit, si quę ad te scribenda haberem, sibi perferenda dare velim.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Nolui itaque tam humaniter ab eo invitatus committere, quin morem geram, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>tametsi te gravissimis negotiis occupatum sciam, ut incivile ducam te inter<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>pellare tibique nęniis meis obgannire, ad hoc quod non parum literę tuę<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Nicht erhalten.</note> me ad rescrib<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>endum<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">rescribendum <hi>für gestrichenes</hi> hoc <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> adhortatę sint, ut, si minus opportunę te accedant, culpa <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>tamen tua, non mea fiat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Ago immensas tibi gratias pro libello<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Zweifellos <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> "Der christliche Ehestand"; vgl. oben <ref target="file11409">Nr. 1366</ref>, 2-6 mit Anm.1.</note> mihi <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>misso.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Non est, ut tantam liberalem tuam munificentiam demereri <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>queam neque paria referre, quod nihil mihi unquam gratius extiterit<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>in der Vorlage</hi> exterit.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quam tantum taleque chartaceum munus elaboratum ex reconditioris <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>theologię penu etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Verba de coena dominica, quae ad me <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>prioribus<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>vor</hi> prioribus <hi>gestrichenes</hi> pridem.</note> literis<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Die Rede ist offenbar von jenem verlorenen Brief, den <persName ref="p3700">Rümlang</persName> am 28. November 1539 verdankt und am 15. Januar 1540 nochmals gerühmt hatte (vgl. <bibl source="b11">HBBW IX</bibl>, S. 251, 1-4, bzw. oben <ref target="file11394">Nr. 1351</ref>, 10-13).</note> scripsisti, hec sunt: „Doleo quidem N.<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Gemeint sind <persName ref="p5837">Sebastian Meyer</persName> und <persName ref="p8401">Peter Kunz</persName>, über deren Abendmahlslehre <persName ref="p3700">Rümlang</persName> am 20. Oktober 1539 berichtet hatte (s. <bibl source="b11">HBBW IX</bibl>, <ref target="file11363">Nr. 1320</ref>).</note> <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>prorsus omnia ad substantialem nescio quem usum referre, cum <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>commendatione manducationis veri corporis Christi poterant esse <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>contenti.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Edimus nos corpus domini non fictum aut pictum<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Vielleicht ein Anklang an <persName ref="p19874">Plautus</persName>, Asinana, 174.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>phantasticum<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Mit diesem Begriff wird auf die Lehre Marcions angespielt, der den Leib Christi als <foreign xml:lang="el">ϕάντασμα</foreign> bezeichnete; vgl. dazu <bibl source="b700">Z</bibl> VI/III 264, 12-19 mit Anm. 5.</note> aut poeticum, sed verum, ut vere de<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d"><hi>vor</hi> de <hi>gestrichenes</hi> passum.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>virgine natum est, passum,<pb type="edition" next="77"/> exsuscitatum<note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e"><hi>in der Vorlage</hi> exuscitatum.</note> et in coelos assumptum<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Vgl. die altkirchlichen Bekenntnisse.</note>; <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>sed edere nobis credere est<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Vgl. <persName ref="p4091">Zwinglis</persName> Auslegung von Joh 6, 48-58 (<bibl source="b700">Z</bibl> III 339, 1. 27-29; 777, 7f u. o.).</note>, credere non tantum cogitare aut imaginari, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>sed frui re presenti, affici, saturari.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Credebat in evangelio <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ille centurio<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 8, 5-13 par</ref></cit>.</note> et presentem sentiebat in puero medelam, licet <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Christus corporaliter in ędes eius nunquam pervenisset.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Qui credunt <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>in Christum verum deum et hominem, vere manducant Christum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>totum, traiiciunt illum in se totum ita, ut vivat in eis <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>et ipsi in eo<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Joh 6, 56 (Vulg. 57)</ref></cit>.</note>, non modo corporali, sed virtute et operatione <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>divina.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Sentiunt ergo pii securitatem<note xml:id="fnf" type="footnote" n="f"><hi>in der Vorlage</hi> sequritatem <hi>(korrigiert aus</hi> sequuritatem).</note>, et illa securitas<note xml:id="fng" type="footnote" n="g"><hi>in der Vorlage</hi> sequritas <hi>(korrigiert aus</hi> sequuritas).</note> saturitas e<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>st.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Hęc vera Christi manducatio est; huius symbolum coena <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>exterior est, memoria mortis domini, exercitatio et refricatio <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>huius fidei, gratiarum actio pro donis dei acceptis<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Die Deutung des Abendmahls als memoria (bzw. commemoratio) und gratiarum actio war schon für <persName ref="p4091">Zwingli</persName> fundamental (vgl. etwa <bibl source="b700">Z</bibl> IV 938, 3 1-36; V 743, 11-13; VI/III 165, 10f).</note>.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Quid ergo <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>opus est animos piorum ita involvere, ut tandem nesciant, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>quid sit coena aut quid sit manducare Christum?</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Et <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>veteres ad evidentiam veritatis sancte usi sunt <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>vocabulis ’signum’, ’significare’, ’sacramenta sunt <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>mysteria et symbola’ etc.“</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Hęc sunt ista plausibilia <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>in literis tuis, quę satis laudibus extollere nequeo, tam <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>sunt rerum pondere gravia verborumque volubilitate et <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>concinnitate venusta atque expedita<note xml:id="fnh" type="footnote" n="h">atque expedita <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Audivi, frater in Christo charissime, <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>de quadam epistola ad <persName ref="p654">Comandrum</persName>, in qua <persName ref="p467">Bucerus</persName> non <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>leviter te perstringat et arrodat<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Vgl. <bibl source="b11">HBBW IX</bibl> <ref target="file11326">[Nr. 1283]</ref>, S. 165, Anm. 9.</note>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Si eius tibi sit copia, <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>bene, tunc poteris tibi prospicere teque purgare; sin minus, <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>curabo, ut eius exemplum mihi transcribatur, quo ad te <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>mittam<note xml:id="fni" type="footnote" n="i"><hi>korrigiert aus</hi> mittatur.</note>.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Dolet spiritum quorundam tam impotentem <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>et suspicacem, ut nihil non in deteriorem partem <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>arripiat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Velim eruditionem et facundiam in aliud <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>quam fratris eversionem et excidium collocari.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Nequeo<note xml:id="fnk" type="footnote" n="k"><hi>vor</hi> Nequeo <hi>gestrichenes</hi> neque.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>malignitatem huiusmodi satis deplorare, qui fratres de re <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>christiana tam optime meritos, ne quid suę famę pereat, <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>tametsi suo merito fiat, tantum non<note xml:id="fnl" type="footnote" n="l">tantum non <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> protritos et exterminatos vel <lb xml:id="p1z48"/>saltem in<note xml:id="fnm" type="footnote" n="m"><hi>vor</hi> in <hi>gestrichenes</hi> erroris.</note> aperta et exposita veritate erroris convictos volunt.<pb type="scan" next="121v."/></s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>At decet christianum, utcunque tumultuetur mundus, intrepidum <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>stare neque commoveri adeoque<note xml:id="fnn" type="footnote" n="n"><hi>vor</hi> adeoque <hi>gestrichenes</hi> tametsi.</note> iustum et <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>tenacem propositi virum nullo quocunque ardore mente <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>quati solida, deo suum negotium committendum nosque sub <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>cruce calumniis quantumvis virulentis exagitatos in hum<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>ilitate pacientię tandem evasuros<note xml:id="fno" type="footnote" n="o"><hi>vor</hi> evasuros <hi>gestrichenes</hi> evad[...].</note> in lętum et exoptatum<note xml:id="fnp" type="footnote" n="p">et exoptatum <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> successum <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>sperare.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Si te purgare vis, cave, ne a solita tua verborum<pb type="edition" next="78"/> <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>mansuetudine excidas; id lectori, qui nullis ducitur affectibus, <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>gratissimum fuerit posterisque praeconio celebrandum videbitur <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Spero ego hic apud nostrates concionatores<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14"><persName ref="p5837">Meyer</persName> und <persName ref="p8401">Kunz</persName> (vgl. oben Anm. 5).</note> atque sentio meliorem <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>animum, quam hactenus prae se tulerint; amice non semel <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>mecum contulere, et quantum possum, conceptam sententiam emol[lio]<note xml:id="fnq" type="footnote" n="q"><hi>Randtext im engen Einband verdeckt.</hi></note> <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>et declino.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Verum<note xml:id="fnr" type="footnote" n="r"><hi>vor</hi> Verum <hi>gestrichenes</hi> Sed.</note> his diebus experiar et audiam <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>deo volente, quid parturierint et quam me spes non frustratura sit, et quicquid eve<lb xml:id="p2z15"/>niet, proxime ad te scribam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale felicissime.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta, quaeso, universum doctorum collegium.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Datum <placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName>, ad multam <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>noctem<note xml:id="fns" type="footnote" n="s">ad multam noctem <hi>am</hi> Rande <hi>nachgetragen.</hi></note>, dominica palmarum anno 1540.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Tuus <persName ref="p3700">Eb. a Rümlang</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse darunter:]</note>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Excellentissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, fratri in <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>Christo charissimo et domino suo semper observando.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="de">Meister <persName ref="p495">Heinrich <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>Bullinger</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>, p<lb xml:id="p2z19"/>redicanten.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
